nk every film should have funny moments","x":0.55555555062836082,"h":0.014746556530352173,"w":0.32510288238525387},{"h":0.01168563612140805,"y":0.35901162797548924,"w":0.31893003463745118,"x":0.55967079046591062,"text":"and there was nothing to laugh at in this one."},{"w":0.34187583923339848,"x":0.55745118564142326,"text":"I also didn't like the main character very much -","h":0.015072244305791682,"y":0.37071174440625165},{"h":0.011627906839719149,"y":0.38517441856415213,"x":0.55761316967669838,"text":"the onethat A","w":0.10288065910339361},{"y":0.3851744186215279,"w":0.14609052658081056,"x":0.742798358623175,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":".on the job of talking"},{"x":0.55761316217165768,"text":"with the aliens - even though she was played by","w":0.34362140655517581,"h":0.013081394879037145,"y":0.39970930262104343},{"y":0.41110828356727569,"text":"an 'A-listed \/","w":0.098871574401855455,"h":0.01208575805098433,"x":0.55961770985164738},{"h":0.01162790683971926,"y":0.41424418604234958,"x":0.75102881150348788,"text":"actor. So, not a great","w":0.15020575523376467},{"x":0.55967078423920935,"text":"film but it's OK","h":0.011639452780229487,"y":0.42586054707858367,"w":0.10493826866149902},{"x":0.55967078427278094,"y":0.44616063539023809,"h":0.013239187996469504,"w":0.33333332061767584,"text":"LaraNYC says: 1 knew from the very beginning"},{"x":0.55761317113510567,"y":0.45930232550455896,"w":0.18518518447875987,"h":0.011627906839719149,"text":"that the professor would B"},{"w":0.078189296722412038,"y":0.46072374245607084,"text":"up her job","x":0.82510288152562528,"h":0.013239187996469504},{"y":0.47383720959173137,"h":0.013081394879037256,"w":0.35185184478759768,"text":"(and possibly her life!) to help the military, but the","x":0.55349794152081033},{"text":"rest of the film was not easy to predict. During","w":0.32510288238525387,"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.48676081184130493,"x":0.55761316460984234},{"w":0.3436214065551757,"text":"the film I felt scared, exci